msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，提供核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力。支持Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法，并针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, providing kernel autotune, operator compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Atlas A2 products, Atlas A3 products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT products. It is compatible with core Triton syntax and deeply optimizes for Ascend NPU features. These optimizations include automatically parsing kernel parameters, optimizing memory access logic, and enhancing secure deployment mechanisms, and so on."

msgid "本指南指导开发者在**Ubuntu**环境下安装**Triton-Ascend**，涵盖快速安装、源码安装及镜像安装三种方式，并包含环境验证与常见问题排查。"
msgstr "This guide instructs developers to install **Triton-Ascend** in an **Ubuntu** environment; it covers three methods: quick installation, source code installation, and image installation, and includes environment verification and troubleshooting."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware requirements**"

msgid "Ascend产品：支持Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。"
msgstr "Ascend products: Support Atlas A2 products, Atlas A3 products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT products."

msgid "NPU配置：建议单卡32GB及以上内存。"
msgstr "NPU configuration: We recommend a single device with 32 GB or more memory."

msgid "操作系统：需Linux系统，具体请参考[兼容性查询助手](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)。"
msgstr "Operating system: Requires a Linux system. For details, refer to the [Compatibility Query Assistant](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)."

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。如需具体安装步骤，请参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine and install the software versions for CANN, Python, and TorchNPU. For specific installation steps, refer to \"[CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\" on the Ascend community website to complete the driver and firmware installation."

msgid "CANN版本：9.2.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.2.0"

msgid "Python版本：3.11"
msgstr "Python version: 3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.10.0.post7"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.10.0.post7"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility information, refer to the [release note table](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Installation"

msgid ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"

msgid "<a id=\"install-from-source\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"install-from-source\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"install-from-source\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"install-from-source\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "源码安装"
msgstr "Source Code Installation"

msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr "Install dependencies"

msgid ""
"apt update\n"
"apt install zlib1g-dev clang-15 lld-15\n"
"apt install ccache # optional\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang clang /usr/bin/clang-15 100\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang++ clang++ /usr/bin/clang++-15 100\n"
"pip install ninja cmake wheel pybind11 # build-time dependencies\n"
msgstr ""
"apt update\n"
"apt install zlib1g-dev clang-15 lld-15\n"
"apt install ccache # optional\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang clang /usr/bin/clang-15 100\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang++ clang++ /usr/bin/clang++-15 100\n"
"pip install ninja cmake wheel pybind11 # build-time dependencies\n"

msgid "编译Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Compiling Triton-Ascend"

msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"git checkout main\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"git checkout main\n"
"pip install -e .\n"

msgid "自定义LLVM构建（可选）"
msgstr "Custom LLVM build (optional)"

msgid "如需自定义构建LLVM，可执行以下步骤编译Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr "If you need to build a custom LLVM, perform the following steps to compile Triton-Ascend."

msgid "**代码准备**：通过`git checkout`检出指定版本的LLVM源码并应用补丁。"
msgstr "**Code preparation**: Check out the specified version of the LLVM source code using `git checkout` and apply the patch."

msgid ""
"git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\n"
"cd llvm-project\n"
"git checkout f6ded0be897e2878612dd903f7e8bb85448269e5\n"
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/main/third_party/ascend/patch/llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
"git apply llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\n"
"cd llvm-project\n"
"git checkout f6ded0be897e2878612dd903f7e8bb85448269e5\n"
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/main/third_party/ascend/patch/llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
"git apply llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"

msgid "**构建LLVM**：路径`/path/llvm-install`为用户规划的LLVM安装路径，需根据实际调整；路径`{PATH_TO}`为第一步中检出LLVM源码的路径。"
msgstr "**Building LLVM**: The path `/path/llvm-install` is your planned LLVM installation path; adjust it as needed. The path `{PATH_TO}` is the path where you checked out the LLVM source code in step 1."

msgid ""
"export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\n"
"cd {PATH_TO}/llvm-project\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../llvm \\\n"
"    -G Ninja \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang++-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_LINKER=/usr/bin/lld-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=\"mlir;llvm;lld\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;NVPTX;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_LLD=ON \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}\n"
"ninja install\n"
"\n"
"cp  {PATH_TO}/llvm-project/build/bin/FileCheck ${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}/bin/FileCheck\n"
msgstr ""
"export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\n"
"cd {PATH_TO}/llvm-project\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../llvm \\\n"
"    -G Ninja \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang++-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_LINKER=/usr/bin/lld-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=\"mlir;llvm;lld\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;NVPTX;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_LLD=ON \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}\n"
"ninja install\n"
"\n"
"cp  {PATH_TO}/llvm-project/build/bin/FileCheck ${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}/bin/FileCheck\n"

msgid "**编译Triton-Ascend**：通过配置LLVM路径定位依赖库，启用ccache加速编译，并关闭Proton和单元测试来减少构建开销。"
msgstr "**Compiling Triton-Ascend**: Configure the LLVM path to locate dependency libraries, enable ccache to accelerate compilation, and disable Proton and unit tests to reduce build overhead."

msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"LLVM_SYSPATH=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX} \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_PROTON=OFF \\\n"
"TRITON_WHEEL_NAME=\"triton_ascend\" \\\n"
"TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS=\"-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF\" \\\n"
"python3 setup.py install\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"LLVM_SYSPATH=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX} \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_PROTON=OFF \\\n"
"TRITON_WHEEL_NAME=\"triton_ascend\" \\\n"
"TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS=\"-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF\" \\\n"
"python3 setup.py install\n"

msgid "**表1**源码编译参数说明表"
msgstr "**Table 1** Source code compilation parameter description"

msgid "参数（环境变量）"
msgstr "Parameters (environment variables)"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

msgid "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"
msgstr "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"

msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

msgid "指定本地已编译好的 LLVM 安装路径。设置后不再下载 LLVM 预编译包，离线构建时必填，即上文构建 LLVM 步骤中的 `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}`。"
msgstr "Specify the installation path of the locally compiled LLVM. After you set this, the precompiled LLVM package is not downloaded. It is required for offline builds, that is, the `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}` in the preceding LLVM build steps."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"

msgid "true"
msgstr "true"

msgid "使用 clang/clang++ 作为编译器、lld 作为链接器，需提前安装 clang>=15、lld>=15。"
msgstr "To use clang/clang++ as the compiler and lld as the linker, install clang>=15 and lld>=15 in advance."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"

msgid "启用 ccache 缓存编译结果，加速重复构建，需提前安装 ccache。"
msgstr "To enable ccache to cache compilation results and speed up repeated builds, install ccache in advance."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"

msgid "OFF"
msgstr "OFF"

msgid "是否构建 Proton 性能分析器（profiler）。需要时设为 `ON`。"
msgstr "Whether to build the Proton profiler. Set to `ON` when needed."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"

msgid "是否构建 TD（Triton-distributed-ascend）相关组件，默认关闭。"
msgstr "Specifies whether to build components related to TD (Triton-distributed-ascend). This option is disabled by default."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"

msgid "是否在安装过程中同步编译 AscendNPU-IR。设为 `ON` 时会触发 `build_npuir.py` 流程；AscendNPU-IR编译依赖CANN，需source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh（以root用户默认安装路径为例）且可用磁盘大于30GB。"
msgstr "Whether to compile AscendNPU-IR during the installation. When set to `ON`, the `build_npuir.py` process is triggered. AscendNPU-IR compilation depends on CANN. You need to run source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh (using the default installation path for the root user as an example). The available disk space must be greater than 30 GB."

msgid "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"
msgstr "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"

msgid "triton_ascend"
msgstr "triton_ascend"

msgid "生成的 wheel 包名称，一般无需修改。"
msgstr "The name of the generated wheel package generally does not need to be modified."

msgid "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"

msgid "追加透传给 CMake 的参数，多个参数用空格分隔。例如追加 `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` 可关闭单元测试构建。"
msgstr "Append parameters to pass to CMake. Separate multiple parameters with spaces. For example, appending `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` disables unit test building."

msgid "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"

msgid "设为 `ON` 后禁止构建过程中访问网络下载依赖（会自动关闭需联网拉取 googletest 的单元测试构建），用于离线环境。"
msgstr "If you set this to `ON`, it prevents the build process from accessing the network to download dependencies (automatically disabling unit test builds that require network access to fetch googletest). Use this for offline environments."

msgid "`MAX_JOBS`"
msgstr "`MAX_JOBS`"

msgid "2 × CPU core"
msgstr "2 × CPU core"

msgid "编译并行任务数。内存紧张时可调小，例如 `export MAX_JOBS=8`。"
msgstr "Number of parallel compilation tasks. You can reduce this value when memory is tight, for example, `export MAX_JOBS=8`."

msgid "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"

msgid "并行链接任务数。链接阶段占用内存较大，内存不足时可设为 `1`。"
msgstr "Number of parallel linking tasks. The linking phase consumes a large amount of memory. If memory is insufficient, set this to `1`."

msgid "`IS_MANYLINUX`"
msgstr "`IS_MANYLINUX`"

msgid "设为 `ON` 后构建生成的 wheel 包为 manylinux 兼容格式，用于在不同 Linux 发行版上安装。"
msgstr "After you set this to `ON`, the generated wheel package is manylinux-compatible for installation across different Linux distributions."

msgid "**(可选)Triton-distributed-ascend**：若使用[Triton-distributed-ascend](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/Triton-distributed-ascend)的功能，需源码编译shmem v1.7.0组件。"
msgstr "**(Optional) Triton-distributed-ascend**: If you use the features of [Triton-distributed-ascend](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/Triton-distributed-ascend), you need to compile the shmem v1.7.0 component from source."

msgid "4.1 获取源码："
msgstr "4.1 Obtain the source code:"

msgid ""
"  git clone https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem.git\n"
"  cd shmem\n"
"  git checkout v1.7.0\n"
msgstr ""
"  git clone https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem.git\n"
"  cd shmem\n"
"  git checkout v1.7.0\n"

msgid "4.2 源码编译："
msgstr "4.2 Source code compilation:"

msgid "参见 [shmem项目](https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem) README.md中 \"安装\"->\"方式三： 源码编译\" 章节。"
msgstr "Refer to the \"Installation\" -> \"Method 3: Compile from Source\" section in the [shmem project](https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem) README.md."

