msgid "运行单元测试（可选）"
msgstr "Run unit tests (Optional)"

msgid "源码仓中提供了单op测试用例，位于`third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut`目录下。"
msgstr "The source code repository provides single-operator test cases in the `third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut` directory."

msgid ""
"# 设置CANN环境变量（以root用户默认安装路径`/usr/local/Ascend`为例）\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# 安装pytest工具，如果有则跳过这一步\n"
"pip install pytest pytest-xdist\n"
"# 运行单个测试用例（以向量加法测试用例为例）\n"
"python -m pytest third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut/test_add.py\n"
msgstr ""
"# Set CANN environment variables (using the default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` for the root user as an example)\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# Install the pytest tool; skip this step if it is already installed\n"
"pip install pytest pytest-xdist\n"
"# Run a single test case (using the vector addition test case as an example)\n"
"python -m pytest third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut/test_add.py\n"

msgid "执行完成后输出示例如下："
msgstr "After the execution is complete, an example of the output is as follows:"

msgid ""
"collected 6 items\n"
"third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut/test_add.py ......\n"
msgstr ""
"collected 6 items\n"
"third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut/test_add.py ......\n"

msgid "如需运行全部测试用例以及打印测试过程信息，可参考以下相关命令："
msgstr "To run all test cases and print test execution information, refer to the following commands:"

msgid ""
"# 串行运行全部用例\n"
"python -m pytest third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"
"\n"
"# 并行运行全部用例，加速测试（需安装pytest-xdist）\n"
"python -m pytest -n 8 third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"
"\n"
"# 打印测试过程详细信息\n"
"python -m pytest -sv -n 8 third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"
msgstr ""
"# Run all test cases in serial\n"
"python -m pytest third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"
"\n"
"# Run all test cases in parallel to accelerate testing (requires pytest-xdist)\n"
"python -m pytest -n 8 third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"
"\n"
"# Print detailed test process information\n"
"python -m pytest -sv -n 8 third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut\n"

msgid "安装常见问题"
msgstr "Installation FAQ"

msgid "**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr "**Issue 1: An error occurs when installing TorchNPU: \"ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu\"**"

msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr "**Solution**"

msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr "You can try manually installing torch, and then install TorchNPU:"

msgid ""
"pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n"

msgid "**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错“ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr "**Issue 2: When compiling and installing Triton-Ascend, if GCC < 9.4.0, you may encounter the error \"ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs\"**"

msgid "一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC 9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr "This error is generally caused by the linker being unable to find the stdc++fs library. This library supports file system features in versions before GCC 9. In this case, manually uncomment the relevant code snippets in the CMake file. File path: triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"

msgid ""
"if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\n"
"link_libraries(stdc++fs)\n"
"endif()\n"
msgstr ""
"if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\n"
"link_libraries(stdc++fs)\n"
"endif()\n"

msgid "**问题三：执行算子时报错“ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package”**"
msgstr "**Problem 3: An error occurs when running an operator: \"ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package\"**"

msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr "**Root cause analysis**"

msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖，导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr "The triton-ascend directory is overwritten by triton, causing triton-ascend functionality to be impaired."

msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend，重新安装即可。以3.2.1版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr "Uninstall the corrupted triton-ascend and reinstall it. For example, to fix version 3.2.1, run the following commands:"

msgid ""
"pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\n"
"pip install triton-ascend==3.2.1 --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"
msgstr ""
"pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\n"
"pip install triton-ascend==3.2.1 --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"

msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr "**Question 4: Why does Triton-Ascend version 3.2.1 add a dependency on triton?**"

msgid "答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-Ascend之后，再次安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr "Answer: Triton-Ascend is a secondary development based on Triton and shares the same installation directory name as Triton. If you install Triton or third-party components that depend on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend, the Triton directory is overwritten. This damages Triton-Ascend functions. Therefore, by adding the Triton dependency, the following prompt appears when Triton is overwritten."

msgid ""
"ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\n"
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 requires triton==3.5.0, but you have triton 3.5.1 which is incompatible.\n"
msgstr ""
"ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\n"
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 requires triton==3.5.0, but you have triton 3.5.1 which is incompatible.\n"

msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可根据问题三的解决措施进行命令修复。"
msgstr "If you encounter this issue and want to restore Triton-Ascend functionality, run the repair commands based on the solution in Problem 3."

msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr "**Question 5: Why is the Triton version dependency inconsistent in Triton-Ascend 3.2.1?**"

msgid "答复：x86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供x86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton 3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr "Answer: x86 and Arm use different versions of the community Triton installation package because the community has provided the x86 installation package since Triton version 3.2, and the Arm installation package since Triton version 3.5."

